// ── R308 — BUG FIX: HSP Listen All button never appears ───────────────────────
// Root cause: _hspRenderBrowse (R306) sets el.innerHTML directly and returns
// undefined. R307 wrapper does `var html = _origBrowse()` (gets undefined),
