// The immigration coach (R786) defines function immNext(){} which, as a hoisted
// function declaration, overwrites the immersion autoplay immNext at line 6123.
// Result: clicking ⏭ in the Immersion overlay increments _immDrillIdx instead
// of immIdx, silently breaking the autoplay card advance.
