// audio element's currentSrc/play against a per-instance "intent" stamped by
// a counter at call time, AND the latest `_speakGen`. If a newer speak's
// stopAllAudio bumped _speakGen between this play call and the audio actually
// being heard, schedule a microtask that pauses + resets the audio element.
// This catches the cross-talk window: A's playAudio runs after B's
// stopAllAudio, audio.src=A briefly, microtask sees _speakGen advanced past
// A's intended gen → pause + reset before B's playAudio runs.
