// bugs.rtf #2 lots of words missing audio. Cultural-coach renders (HAM/ACH/WSF
// + 4 older spots) used `onclick="speak(${JSON.stringify(w.ar)})"` which embeds
// double-quote chars from JSON.stringify INSIDE a double-quoted HTML attribute.
// HTML5 parser ends the attribute at the first inner `"`, leaving the onclick
// handler as just "speak(" — a SyntaxError silently dropped on click. Cards
